From: XiaoShao <26596822+xiaoshao9704@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: declare PPE flow stats helper before its first use

The preceding flow-stats patch calls this helper from the FOE entries
printer before its definition later in the file. Declare the static bool
helper before either caller to avoid an implicit int declaration and the
subsequent conflicting type error. No runtime behavior changes.

--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe_debugfs.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe_debugfs.c
@@ -9,6 +9,8 @@
 #include "airoha_regs.h"
 #include "airoha_eth.h"
 
+static bool airoha_ppe_flow_stats_available(struct airoha_ppe *ppe);
+
 static void airoha_debugfs_ppe_print_tuple(struct seq_file *m,
 					   void *src_addr, void *dest_addr,
 					   u16 *src_port, u16 *dest_port,
